  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Operation VANUATU ASSIST 24</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On 17 Dec 2024 a 7.3 magnitude earthquake struck near Vanuatu Capital, Port Vila causing widespread damage and triggering landslides including 14 deaths and thousand displaced. This investment reflects the ODA-eligible elements of the Australian Defence Force  humanitarian support and Australian commitment for Vanuatu Govt. The ADF worked closely with the Vanuatu Government and other agencies to provide logistical support, including transporting emergency responders, and delivering over 88,260 kg of emergency relief supplies including repatriation of total of 686 Australians.</narrative>
  </description>
